ing to get  these samples from both folks who are  unvaccinated and vaccinated correct  yes we are looking to get samples from  people who are vaccinated and  unvaccinated people who have been  infected and people who haven't been  infected we really need to look at  everyone to get a clear picture of  what's happening in our community  well if you're interested in  participating head over to our website  8newsnow.com
 

